<https://example.org/imaks/id/provenance/DS-MECH-4400-EX-001> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#sourceQuote> """Application Note — Alarm Threshold Setting: With a total accuracy of ±0.10 bar, alarm thresholds should be set at
least 5× the accuracy (0.50 bar) from the nominal operating point to avoid nuisance alarms. Thresholds closer than
3× accuracy (0.30 bar) are not recommended for process control.
2. Electromagnetic Flowmeter FLW-4450""" .
