<https://example.org/imaks/id/provenance/DS-THERM-2200-EX-004> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#sourceQuote> """Note 1 — Maximum Operating Temperature: The rated maximum for continuous operation is 200°C. Exposure
above this value accelerates thermocouple ageing and may cause drift of up to ±5°C within 500 hours. For
applications requiring sustained operation above 200°C, ThermoSense recommends the Series 2400 (Pt100 RTD,
rated to 250°C continuous).
2. Humidity Sensor HUM-2250 — Specifications""" .
