<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-002-EX-046> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#conditionText> "DRIFT: Monotonic deviation >15 min; Detection Criterion: Slope >0.1σ/min for 5+ readings. Ontology Class: AnomalyEvent::Drift" .
<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-002-EX-046> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#extractionMethod> "새 대화에서 수행한 문서 전체 LLM 추출" .
