<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-002-EX-047> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#conditionText> "STUCK: Unchanged >10 consecutive readings; Detection Criterion: std(last 10)<0.001×nominal. Ontology Class: AnomalyEvent::StuckSensor" .
