<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-002-EX-048> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#conditionText> "OUT_OF_RANGE: Sustained WARN violation >10 min; Detection Criterion: >WARN for 20+ readings. Ontology Class: AnomalyEvent::OutOfRange" .
