<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-002-EX-049> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#conditionText> "CORRELATED: Causally linked to another station; Detection Criterion: Onset within 90 min of cause. Ontology Class: AnomalyEvent::Correlated" .
