<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#Rule> .
<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-001> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#actionTarget> <https://example.org/imaks/id/station/ST02_SEALING> .
<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-001> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#actionTarget> <https://example.org/imaks/id/station/ST04_PACKAGING> .
<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-001> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#appliesToSensor> <https://example.org/imaks/id/sensor/ST02_SEALING_CUR> .
<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-001> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#appliesToSensor> <https://example.org/imaks/id/sensor/ST04_PACKAGING_SPD> .
<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-001> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#conditionText> "ST02_SEALING-CUR↑ → ST04_PACKAGING-SPD↓; primary fault: sealing motor overload; secondary effect: conveyor speed drop via electrical coupling" .
<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-001> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#extractionMethod> "새 대화에서 수행한 문서 전체 LLM 추출" .
