<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-001> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#identifier> "SOP-003-EX-001" .
<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-001> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#responseText> "1.Verify ST02-CUR trend. 2.Inspect sealing jaw. 3.Reset ST04 speed setpoint." .
<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-001> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#sourceDocument> <https://example.org/imaks/id/document/SOP-003> .
