<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-002> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#conditionText> "SRV01-TMP↑ → SCADA latency↑; primary fault: Server Room overheating; secondary effect: increased scan time → apparent STUCK readings" .
<https://example.org/imaks/id/rule/SOP-003-EX-002> <https://example.org/imaks/v1#extractionMethod> "새 대화에서 수행한 문서 전체 LLM 추출" .
